0.9.0 14oct2026
* bound SSH connection, SFTP negotiation and SFTP requests with configurable timeouts
* fail incomplete transfers without advancing upload state or logging false success
* atomically save destination-aware caches after successful transfers only
* add optional known_hosts verification, identity controls and progress logging
* use WeeWX runtime report configuration and key authentication in command-line uploads
* see README migration warning: timeout defaults and legacy-cache full upload

0.8 31aug2026
* refactor SFTPUploader to use Paramiko instead of pysftp
* improve connection error handling and retry cleanup
* drop Python 2 / pre-4.0 WeeWX logging and pickle shims
* add unit tests, ruff linting, and GitHub Actions CI + release workflows
* modernize README for WeeWX 5 (weectl extension install)

0.7 10may2020
* use binary mode for cPickle to ensure python3 compatibility

0.6 12mar2020
* parameterize command-line args for easier direct testing
* added support for private key and private key password

0.5 24apr2019
* update readme
* default to port 22 instead of 2222

0.4 08oct2018
* fixed typo in the log info

0.3 16sep2018
* fixed python module path bug in default skin.conf

0.2 08jul2018
* install a skin.conf file too, not just the generator
* install default values in the weewx config file to make installation easier

0.1 03mar2018
* initial release
